# Integrated Expense, Attendance, Grading and Billing Manager

## Technology
Python 3.8+
Standard Python library
Console / CLI based

## Features

1. Expense Management
2. Attendance Management
3. Grading System
4. Billing System
5. Combined Reports

## Project Structure

main.py
validators.py
expenses.py
attendance.py
grading.py
billing.py
reports.py
tests/test_cases.md
README.md

## How to Run in PyCharm

1. Open the project folder in PyCharm.
2. Make sure all Python files are in the same project folder.
3. Open main.py.
4. Right-click main.py.
5. Select Run 'main'.

## Student Identification

Registration/Roll No. is unique and is used as the
dictionary key for attendance and grading records.

## Grading Scale

90-100   A+
80-89.99 A
70-79.99 B
60-69.99 C
50-59.99 D
35-49.99 E
Below 35 F

If any subject mark is below 35, the student FAILS.

## Attendance

>= 75%       Eligible
60-74.99%    Warning
< 60%        Shortage

## Billing

Below 1000       0%
1000-4999.99     5%
5000-9999.99     10%
10000 and above  15%

Tax = 18%

## Important

The program is console-based and does not use GUI.
Data is stored in memory during program execution.